# Paths this module's image build excludes from its own context. Each
# services/*/Dockerfile builds from this directory, and a context has no ignore
# file unless it carries one, so the ignore file at the card-platform root governs
# a root-context build and this one governs this module.
#
# The build reads exactly one path: the archive Maven wrote under target/. Every
# entry below is something the build does not read, and every byte excluded is a
# byte not sent to the daemon.

# Sources. No stage compiles anything: both stages run the Java Runtime
# Environment image, and the archive arrives already built.
src/

# Build files and documentation. The image build resolves no dependency and reads
# no guide.
pom.xml
README.md

# Everything under target/ other than the archive. The pre-repackage archive, the
# class files, the generated sources and the test reports are all build by-products
# the image never carries.
target/*.original
target/classes/
target/test-classes/
target/generated-sources/
target/generated-test-sources/
target/maven-status/
target/maven-archiver/
target/surefire-reports/
target/failsafe-reports/
target/site/

# Editor and operating-system artefacts.
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
